[[0,13362,0,30,0,30,"2014-06-27T16:02:00","Teh_Sauce_Guy","",[],"","Guy claims \"subverse for calling bullshit\", no indication of such things inside of subverse","http://i.imgur.com/hp26mDo.png","quityourbullshit"],[1,12270,0,1,0,1,"2014-06-27T16:07:00","Tylan","[e]",[],"<p>Isn't he just advertising his new subverse since it's in <a href=\"https://voat.co/v/newsubverses\">/v/newsubverses</a>? Unless you were making a joke that I failed to grasp.</p>"],[2,12287,12270,1,0,1,"2014-06-27T16:45:00","Nite","[e]",[],"<p>It's a joke aha. At least I hope so. :P</p>"],[1,12343,0,5,0,5,"2014-06-27T18:33:00","gndn","",[],"<p>Ha, I'm a moderator on the <a href=\"http://reddit.com/r/quityourbullshit\">actual quityourbullshit</a> - nice to see it migrating over to whoaverse.</p>"],[2,12473,12343,3,0,3,"2014-06-27T22:28:00","Nite","",[],"<p>Would you like to be a mod on here as well?</p>"],[3,12490,12473,2,0,2,"2014-06-27T22:54:00","gndn","",[],"<p>I think it will be a while before you get enough activity in this subverse to require extra moderators, but yeah, if you ever need a helping hand, I would be willing to help out with spam and rule violations and whatnot.</p>"],[4,13702,12490,0,0,0,"2014-06-30T02:21:00","Nite","",[],"<p>I hate not being able to view alerts. I will go ahead and invite you. :)</p>"]]
